      "text": "1. RETRIEVE  — sirf relevant cheez andar lao (RAG, filters)\n2. PRUNE     — purane tool results / turns hata do\n3. COMPACT   — summary banao (failed approaches PRESERVE karo)\n4. OFFLOAD   — bade artifacts file/DB mein, context mein sirf pointer",
